WEBVTT

00:18:29.556 --> 00:18:32.739
how she was going to learn
all this new material so quickly.

00:18:32.763 --> 00:18:35.136
Her company gave her access to BetterUp,

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.871
a leading mobile coaching platform

00:18:36.895 --> 00:18:39.186
where professionals can tackle
challenges at work

00:18:39.210 --> 00:18:41.309
with the help of expert coaches.

00:18:41.333 --> 00:18:43.035
She figured she'd give it a shot.

00:18:43.059 --> 00:18:44.369
RB: I've got to be honest,

00:18:44.393 --> 00:18:47.317
I was a little skeptical
of coaching by virtual means.

00:18:47.341 --> 00:18:49.861
AG: But when Rachel met
her BetterUp coach, Victoria,

00:18:49.885 --> 00:18:51.042
on video chat,

00:18:51.066 --> 00:18:52.660
she was surprised at the outcome.

00:18:52.684 --> 00:18:55.688
RB: I remember my first session,
because I had an epiphany.

00:18:55.712 --> 00:18:59.060
Victoria said to me, "Clearly
you've learned stuff through your career,

00:18:59.084 --> 00:19:00.912
how are you going about learning now?"